    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43520" root="&#xA;                        محق&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَقَ</span></b> 
                        , aor. 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَقَ</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْقٌ</span>, <i>He rendered</i> a
thing <i>deficient, and deprived</i> it <i>of its blessing,
or increase:</i> or [<i>he annihilated, annulled,</i> or
<i>obliterated,</i> it;] <i>he did away with</i> it <i>wholly, so
that no trace thereof remained.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْمَدُ مِنْ كَيْلٍ مُحِّقَ</span></b> , or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحِقَ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمَدَ</span>.

